    <briefdescription>
<para>Apply a function to the distance to a fixed point. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>A particle is scored based on the distance between it and a constant point as passed to a UnaryFunction. This is useful for anchoring constraining particles within a sphere.</para>
<para>To restrain a set of particles store in SingletonContainer pc in a sphere do the following: <htmlonly></htmlonly> </para>
